-- נספחים ב'4 ו־ג'4 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102): the Ofek 2022 supplement of a second-degree (MA) teacher on the conversion table
-- (rating code 102), by grade — from 1.9.2022 (annex ב'4) and, twice as much,
-- from 1.9.2023 (annex ג'4) — as the conditions-of-service portal publishes
-- them: a page of the wage agreement of 19.10.2022 as signed, with its
-- hand-written page number and the parties' note that the annexes are
-- agreed. They are annexes ב4 and ג4 of that agreement, whose §5 pays the
-- supplement by them, and which the agreement's signed copy prints after
-- its signatures (encoded, imported).
--
-- Checked here: each is the signed copy's annex grade for grade, and
-- prints the day the signed copy's prints.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספחים ב'4 ו־ג'4 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102)`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח ב'4"; the table below it is annex ב'4.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 The page number written in by hand (8); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p3 "טבלה מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2022", printed above the table's title as well as under it; the day is cited below.
-- akn:hc_1/p6 The annex's label, "נספח ג'4"; the table below it is annex ג'4.
-- akn:hc_1/p9 "נספחים א1-א9, ב1-ב7 מוסכמים": the parties' note that the annexes are agreed; no rule of its own.

-- Annex ב'4, as it prints under it: "מעודכן החל מיום 1.9.2022".
@ref akn:hc_1/p4 akn:hc_1/t1 akn:hc_1/p5 akn:hc_1/p3
`annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102)" (JUST 102) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
        (LIST `cell` 1 832.44, `cell` 1.5 766.81, `cell` 2 701.19, `cell` 2.5 635.56, `cell` 3 569.94, `cell` 3.5 504.31, `cell` 4 438.69, `cell` 4.5 373.06, `cell` 5 307.44, `cell` 5.5 241.81, `cell` 6 176.19, `cell` 6.5 136.81, `cell` 7 97.44, `cell` 7.5 58.06, `cell` 8 18.69, `cell` 8.5 9.34, `cell` 9 0.00)

-- Annex ג'4, as it prints under it: "מעודכן החל מיום 1.9.2023".
@ref akn:hc_1/p7 akn:hc_1/t2 akn:hc_1/p8
`annex ג'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר MA (קוד דירוג 102)" (JUST 102) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023)
        (LIST `cell` 1 1664.87, `cell` 1.5 1533.62, `cell` 2 1402.37, `cell` 2.5 1271.12, `cell` 3 1139.87, `cell` 3.5 1008.62, `cell` 4 877.37, `cell` 4.5 746.12, `cell` 5 614.87, `cell` 5.5 483.62, `cell` 6 352.37, `cell` 6.5 273.62, `cell` 7 194.87, `cell` 7.5 116.12, `cell` 8 37.37, `cell` 8.5 18.69, `cell` 9 0.00)

§§ `בדיקת הטבלאות`

-- (1) The days each prints, as the signed copy's annexes print them.
#ASSERT `annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex ב4 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex ג'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex ג4 of the signed copy`

-- (2) The signed copy's annexes ב4 and ג4, grade for grade, seventeen grades
-- each (1 to 9 by halves).
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ב4 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ג4 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ב4 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ג4 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT `the annex as the decision of 14.1.2025 has it` `annex ב4 of the signed copy` EQUALS `annex ב4 of the signed copy`

-- (3) The decision of 14.1.2025 (§3) puts annexes ב2 and ג2, printed to the
-- agora, in place of the agreement's annexes printed to the shekel; at every
-- whole grade they are these annexes' amounts.
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ב2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ג2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ג'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 102 in` `annex ב2 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 9

-- The supplements at work: §5's supplement for a full position at grade
-- 1.5 on 1.9.2022, as the signed copy pays it, beside annex ב'4.
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex ב'4 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1.5 EQUALS `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 4 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1.5 1
